            <title>1.8.3</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 10:24:10 -0500</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/ajawzero/fieldbook-updates/releases/latest</link>
            <sparkle:version>15</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.8.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[A minor update.

### Added

- **Tables in your notes and account notes:** paste a table from Google Docs, Word, Excel, Google Sheets, or a web page and it stays a table (tab-separated text becomes one too), or choose **Format › Insert Table…** or the table button in the formatting bar. Double-click a table (or right-click › **Edit Table…**) to change its cells, add or remove rows and columns, or remove it. Tables are saved as Markdown tables; the AI and search read each row as a line. Copying a table to another app pastes it as tab-separated rows.
- Spelling is underlined as you type a meeting's title, in **New Manual Meeting** and when renaming a meeting. Nothing is corrected automatically.

### Changed

- Files in a folder's **Files** and meeting attachments can now be up to 500 MB each (was 50 MB). Word, Excel, PowerPoint, and text files over 100 MB are kept but too large to read for summaries; PDFs and images are read at any size.
]]></description>
