        <item>
            <title>1.8.2</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 09:07:25 -0500</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/ajawzero/fieldbook-updates/releases/latest</link>
            <sparkle:version>14</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.8.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[A minor update.

### Added

- **Formatting in your notes and account notes:** bold, italic, underline, text styles (Title, Heading, Subheading, Body, Monospaced), and bulleted and numbered lists, from a bar above the notes, the new **Format** menu, or shortcuts (⌘B, ⌘I, ⌘U, ⇧⌘7, ⇧⌘9, and more). Typing "- " or "1. " starts a list; Tab and Shift-Tab change its level. Pasting from Mail, Word, or a web page keeps bold, italic, underline, and lists.

### Changed

- Notes are saved as Markdown, so formatting shows in any text editor. Existing notes that already used Markdown, such as lines starting with "- ", now show as formatted lists. The AI and search get the words without the formatting.
]]></description>
